  "note": "The identically indexed curds in Genesis 18:8 are חֶמְאָה, a dairy food. The name Jahmai is filed under חמה and its single occurrence in 1 Chronicles 7:2 gives no derivation. The relationship between יחם and חמם merits further comparison. SEDRA indexes the Syriac anger family under חמת."
